            "title": "JPMorgan takes over Apple card, Paramount reaffirms WBD bid",
            "description": "<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>) reaching a deal to sell its Apple credit card (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) to JPMorgan Chase (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>), Paramount Skydance (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PSKY\">PSKY</a>) reaffirming its offer to acquire Warner Bros. Discovery (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>), and CrowdStrike's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CRWD\">CRWD</a>) $740 million purchase of SGNL.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
